### Section 3.3 — Why Us? (Comparison with Existing Tools)

**Heading:** **"Why not just use Flyway, Prisma, or AWS DMS?"**

A comparison table displayed on the Features page showing exactly where existing tools fall short:

| Tool | What it does | What it can't do |
|------|-------------|------------------|
| **Flyway** | Runs SQL scripts you write manually | You write every script by hand. Zero AI. Zero safety checks. One typo crashes production. |
| **Prisma Migrate** | Manages schema changes if you use Prisma ORM | Completely locked to Prisma. No MongoDB → PostgreSQL migration. Weak rollback support. |
| **Liquibase** | Enterprise schema versioning | Extremely complex XML/YAML config. Safety checks cost money (enterprise license). |
| **Bytebase** | Approval workflow for SQL changes | Requires heavy infrastructure. Focuses on approving SQL, not generating or validating it intelligently. |
| **AWS DMS** | Live data replication in the cloud | Hard to configure. Dumps MongoDB arrays as raw JSON into a single column — you still have to clean everything manually. |
| ✅ **Migration Planner** | All of the above, guided by AI | Nothing. It's what we built. |

Below the table, a short paragraph:
*"Every existing tool either requires you to be an expert, locks you into an ecosystem, or moves data without helping you understand what changed or how to undo it. Migration Planner is the only tool that combines AI schema understanding, real-time risk analysis, dry-run simulation, and automatic rollback — all in one guided wizard."*

